<view class="page"><view class="title">我的出钓</view><view class="sub">免登录本机记录。清除数据、卸载或换设备后不会自动恢复；小程序与iPhone网页数据相互独立。</view><button bindtap="points">本机钓点记录</button><view wx:if="{{!plans.length}}" class="empty">暂无出钓计划，请在首页选择地点和日期后添加。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.place.name}} · {{item.date}}</view><view class="label">出发时间</view><picker mode="time" value="{{item.time}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="time" bindchange="edit"><view class="picker">{{item.time}}</view></picker><textarea class="input" value="{{item.note}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="note" maxlength="300" placeholder="出钓备注" bindinput="edit"/><button class="primary" bindtap="save" data-id="{{item.id}}">保存计划</button><view class="row"><button bindtap="weather" data-id="{{item.id}}">查看天气</button><button bindtap="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}">移除</button></view></view><button bindtap="about">数据与隐私</button></view>
